  dialogue:
  - "\"Do you ever feel\u2026 out of place here? Like this isn\u2019t where you\u2019re
    supposed to be...?\""
  - Out of place?
  - "This is just a temporary arrangement. The workshop will send for me soon\u2014they
    must. I\u2019m far too important to be left here indefinitely.\r\n"
  - "Besides, I don\u2019t see why it matters. My work is my purpose; as long as
    I can create, I\u2019m exactly where I need to be. Everything else is\u2026 irrelevant.\r\n"
